The '''prison barge landing bays''' were three<ref name="One Way Out" /> docking ports where [[Imperial Prison Transport|prison barges]] would connect to in order to deploy prisoners in [[Narkina 5 Imperial Prison Complex]] cylinders.<ref name="Narkina 5" /> They were located on [[Level 8]], close to the [[Command center (Narkina 5)|cylinder command center]]. During the [[Narkina 5 prison escape]], escaping prisoners jumped from the landing bays into the water below.<ref name="One Way Out" />

